                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "9bc177ae-ce79-33ba-b570-fb54c18909a3",
                        "entry_id": "60274a43-763d-3979-a9fc-cacf6b10d1df",
                        "glosses": [
                            "stoker"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "81b42114-1688-4a5c-910f-1cb318a8cca9",
                                "sense_id": "9bc177ae-ce79-33ba-b570-fb54c18909a3",
                                "text": "Жена́ смотри́теля то́тчас с не́ю разговори́лась, объяви́ла, что она́ племя́нница придво́рного истопника́, и посвяти́ла её во все та́инства придво́рной жи́зни.",
                                "translation": "The station-master's wife immediately entered into conversation with her, informed her that she was the niece of a fire-lighter at the palace, and initiated her into all the mysteries of court life.",
                                "english": "The station-master's wife immediately entered into conversation with her, informed her that she was the niece of a fire-lighter at the palace, and initiated her into all the mysteries of court life."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7f7f3c33-1472-4995-b6b2-a8a2682d09a2",
                                "sense_id": "9bc177ae-ce79-33ba-b570-fb54c18909a3",
                                "text": "На мину́ту она́ опо́мнилась и поняла́, что воше́дший худо́й мужи́к в дли́нном на́нковом пальто́, на кото́ром недостава́ло пу́говицы, был истопни́к, что он смотре́л на термо́метр, что ве́тер и снег ворвали́сь за ним в дверь; но пото́м опя́ть всё смеша́лось…",
                                "translation": "For a moment she regained her self-possession, and realized that the thin peasant who had come in wearing a long overcoat, with buttons missing from it, was the stoveheater, that he was looking at the thermometer, that it was the wind and snow bursting in after him at the door; but then everything grew blurred again....",
                                "english": "For a moment she regained her self-possession, and realized that the thin peasant who had come in wearing a long overcoat, with buttons missing from it, was the stoveheater, that he was looking at the thermometer, that it was the wind and snow bursting in after him at the door; but then everything grew blurred again...."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a504f11a-78cc-45e0-8fde-da6676396517",
                                "sense_id": "9bc177ae-ce79-33ba-b570-fb54c18909a3",
                                "text": "Каза́лось, что сли́шком ча́сто истопни́к входи́л и погля́дывал на термо́метр, что шум встре́чного по́езда и гро́хот колёс по мосту́ слы́шались без переры́ва.",
                                "translation": "It seemed to him that the stove-heater came in too often to look at the thermometer, and that trains never stopped passing and his own train was always roaring over bridges.",
                                "english": "It seemed to him that the stove-heater came in too often to look at the thermometer, and that trains never stopped passing and his own train was always roaring over bridges."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d721b54a-352d-4975-a3d9-393cb1b41b73",
                                "sense_id": "9bc177ae-ce79-33ba-b570-fb54c18909a3",
                                "text": "Зате́м он призва́л на́шего уважа́емого маляра́-арти́ста — ко́мика-режиссёра — бы́вшего ремо́нтного рабо́чего, а ныне истопника́ и соверше́нно безыде́йного худо́жника Петру́шку и вручи́л ему́ де́ньги и свой эски́з.",
                                "translation": "Mikhail Bulgakov",
                                "english": "Mikhail Bulgakov"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
